<h1>Refund Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Version 1.0, dated 16 October 2026.</strong></p>

<h2>1. No payments collected</h2>
<p>AcxiomCRM collects no licence fees, subscriptions, setup fees or other payments in this deployment. Because no payment is taken, no refund applies and there is no billing cycle, GST invoice, or chargeback process for this service.</p>

<h2>2. Third-party charges</h2>
<p>Any hosting, domain, SMS gateway or email delivery charges are billed directly by those providers under their own terms and refund policies. Questions about such charges should go to the relevant provider in the first instance.</p>

<h2>3. Billing queries</h2>
<p>For any billing question about this service, contact <a href="mailto:support@example.in">support@example.in</a> or <a href="tel:+911234567890">+91 12345 67890</a> (Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00 IST). Queries are answered within 7 working days.</p>
